CC0 1.0 Universal

Statement of Purpose

The laws of most jurisdictions throughout the world automatically confer
exclusive Copyright and Related Rights upon the creator and subsequent
owner(s).

Certain owners wish to permanently relinquish those rights for the benefit of
the public. For those purposes, and to the fullest extent permitted by law, the
Affirmer waives and abandons all Copyright and Related Rights in this work and
dedicates the work to the public domain worldwide.

For the complete legal code, see:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
